<Item XName="powerToPowerDensity" UserName="powerToPowerDensity" Type="function">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>function pwrDensity_dBm = powerToPowerDensity(power_dBm, freq_GHz, efficiency_dB)&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;% power_mW = powerDensity_mW_per_m2 * aperture = powerDensity * lambda^2 / 4 / pi * Directivity * Efficiency&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;speedOfLight = 299792458;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;power_mW = 10^(power_dBm / 10);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;lambda = speedOfLight / (freq_GHz*1e9);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;efficiency = 10^(efficiency_dB / 10);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;pwrDensity_mW = power_mW * 4 * pi / lambda^2 / efficiency;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;pwrDensity_dBm = 10 * log10(pwrDensity_mW);&#x000D;&#x000A;end</Text>
